<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>

<PropertyList>

	<name>scenario28</name>
	<layout>vbox</layout>

	<group>
		<layout>hbox</layout>
		<text>
			<halign>left</halign>
			<label>模拟空战训练情景</label>
			<!--<format>%s Control Panel</format>
			<property>sim/description</property>-->
		</text>
		<button>
			<halign>right</halign>
			<pref-width>20</pref-width>
			<pref-height>20</pref-height>
			<legend>X</legend>
			<key>Esc</key>
			<binding>
				<command>dialog-close</command>
			</binding>
		</button>
	</group>
	
	<hrule/>

	<group>
	    <layout>hbox</layout>
	    <button>
	    	<legend>0</legend>
		    <binding>
				<command>nasal</command>
				<script>
					mig28.start(0);
				</script>
	      	</binding>
	    </button>
	    <button>
	    	<legend>1</legend>
		    <binding>
				<command>nasal</command>
				<script>
					mig28.start(1);
				</script>
	      	</binding>
	    </button>
	    <button>
	    	<legend>2</legend>
		    <binding>
				<command>nasal</command>
				<script>
					mig28.start(2);
				</script>
	      	</binding>
	    </button>
	    <button>
	    	<legend>3</legend>
		    <binding>
				<command>nasal</command>
				<script>
					mig28.start(3);
				</script>
	      	</binding>
	    </button>
	    <button>
	    	<legend>4</legend>
		    <binding>
				<command>nasal</command>
				<script>
					mig28.start(4);
				</script>
	      	</binding>
	    </button>
	    <button>
	    	<legend>5</legend>
		    <binding>
				<command>nasal</command>
				<script>
					mig28.start(5);
				</script>
	      	</binding>
	    </button>
	    <button>
	    	<legend>6</legend>
		    <binding>
				<command>nasal</command>
				<script>
					mig28.start(6);
				</script>
	      	</binding>
	    </button>
	    <button>
	    	<legend>Stop</legend>
		    <binding>
				<command>nasal</command>
				<script>
					mig28.stop();
				</script>
	      	</binding>
	      	<color>
      		    <red>1</red>
      		    <green>0.35</green>
      		    <blue>0.35</blue>
      	    </color>
	    </button>

	</group>

	<hrule/>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>等级说明：</label></text>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>0（ACM）- 一架敌机，一架僚机（新手）</label></text>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>1（BFM）- 一架敌机（新手）</label></text>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>2（BFM）- 一架敌机（有经验）</label></text>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>3（BFM）- 一架敌机（老兵）</label></text>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>4（ACM）- 两架敌机（新手）</label></text>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>5（ACM）- 两架敌机（老兵）</label></text>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>6（ACM）- 三架敌机，一架僚机（老兵）</label></text>
	<empty><stretch>1</stretch></empty>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>自动对手将驾驶 Block 52。</label></text>
	<hrule/>

	<text><halign>left</halign><label>注意：情景运行中时，请先点击停止再启动另一个。</label></text>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>要命中目标，用 HUD 准星符号对准敌机瞄准一秒钟。</label></text>
	<text><halign>left</halign><label>老兵会关闭应答机，因此不会一直出现在 RWR 上。</label></text>

	<empty><stretch>1</stretch></empty>

</PropertyList>